"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
2750,"Narrated to us al-ʿAbbās ibn Muḥammad al-Dūrī, narrated to us Abū Ghassān Mālik ibn Ismāʿīl ibn Dirham, who informed us ʿAbd al-Salām ibn Ḥarb, from Shuʿbah, from ʿĀṣim, from al-Shaʿbī, from Ibn ʿAbbās (RA) that the Prophet (ﷺ) drank water during the Tawāf.

**CHAPTER:**"
